<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 396 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 396 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 396 contracts compared with 818 overnight Wednesday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 27 wheat, 139 corn, 178 soybean, one soymeal, nine soyoil, five oat and 37 corn calls traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady to 1/4 cent lower, corn was steady and soybeans were 1-1/4 cents per bushel lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
